h 2 (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_013_s16","report_id":"v3feat_013","text":"At epoch 5, the loss of VGG-16 is 0.797 (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_013_s17","report_id":"v3feat_013","text":"At epoch 3, BERT-base reaches its maximum loss of 0.711.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_013_s18","report_id":"v3feat_013","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null}]}